29/api/v4/projects/13/issues?labels=priority&state=opened\"\\n', is_input=False, thought=\"I can see that the page is still showing all open issues (12 total) and the priority filter didn't work. Let me try using the GitLab API approach as mentioned in the SOP. Let me first get the project ID and then use the API to fetch priority issues.\", blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='[{\"id\":22207,\"iid\":164,\"project_id\":13,\"title\":\"[FEAT]: Unify evaluation prompt and episode rendering for human readers\",\"description\":\"### Description\\\\n\\\\nHuman readers have the potential to serve as judges. However, the discrepancy between evaluation prompt episode rendering for human readers causes trouble on the issue.\\\\n\\\\n### Additional Information\\\\n\\\\nI am specifically talking about:\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n```python\\\\r\\\\nclass EpisodeLog(JsonModel):\\\\r\\\\n...\\\\r\\\\n    def render_for_humans(self) -\\\\u003e tuple[list[AgentProfile], list[str]]:\\\\r\\\\n...\\\\r\\\\n```\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nAnd there\\'s discrepancy between how evaluation prompt is composed:\\\\r\\\\n```python\\\\r\\\\n    @gin.configurable\\\\r\\\\n    @beartype\\\\r\\\\n    async def __acall__(\\\\r\\\\n        self,\\\\r\\\\n        turn_number: int,\\\\r\\\\n        messages: list[tuple[str, Message]] | None,\\\\r\\\\n        history: str = \\\\\"\\\\\",\\\\r\\\\n        temperature: float = 0.0,\\\\r\\\\n    ) -\\\\u003e list[tuple[str, tuple[tuple[str, int | float | bool], str]]]:\\\\r\\\\n        # filter did nothing\\\\r\\\\n        if not history and messages:\\\\r\\\\n            messages_filtered = [\\\\r\\\\n                (x, y)\\\\r\\\\n                for x, y in messages\\\\r\\\\n                if \\\\\"did nothing\\\\\" not in y.to_natural_language()\\\\r\\\\n            ]\\\\r\\\\n            history = \\\\\"\\\\\\\\n\\\\\".join(\\\\r\\\\n                [\\\\r\\\\n                    (\\\\r\\\\n                        f\\\\\"{x} {y.to_natural_language()}\\\\\"\\\\r\\\\n                        if x != \\\\\"Environment\\\\\"\\\\r\\\\n                        else y.to_natural_language()\\\\r\\\\n                    )\\\\r\\\\n                    for x, y in messages_filtered\\\\r\\\\n                ]\\\\r\\\\n            )\\\\r\\\\n```\",\"state\":\"opened\",\"created_at\":\"2024-08-06T22:12:52.000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-08-06T22:13:02.000Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"closed_by\":null,\"labels\":[\"enhancement\",\"priority\"],\"milestone\":null,\"assignees\":[],\"author\":{\"id\":1,\"username\":\"root\",\"name\":\"Administrator\",\"state\":\"active\",\"locked\":false,\"avatar_url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/bc780a96456fadbe364f4d9b9ef1276c288db81171546a91d8331887c81b9cf3?s=80\\\\u0026d=identicon\",\"web_url\":\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root\"},\"type\":\"ISSUE\",\"assignee\":null,\"user_notes_count\":0,\"merge_requests_count\":0,\"upvotes\":0,\"downvotes\":0,\"due_date\":null,\"confidential\":false,\"discussion_locked\":null,\"issue_type\":\"issue\",\"web_url\":\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia/-/issues/164\",\"time_stats\":{\"time_estimate\":0,\"total_time_spent\":0,\"human_time_estimate\":null,\"human_total_time_spent\":null},\"task_completion_status\":{\"count\":0,\"completed_count\":0},\"has_tasks\":true,\"task_status\":\"0 of 0 checklist items completed\",\"_links\":{\"self\":\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13/issues/164\",\"notes\":\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13/issues/164/notes\",\"award_emoji\":\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13/issues/164/award_emoji\",\"project\":\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13\",\"closed_as_duplicate_of\":null},\"references\":{\"short\":\"#164\",\"relative\":\"#164\",\"full\":\"root/sotopia#164\"},\"severity\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"moved_to_id\":null,\"imported\":